From: Hui Min Mina Chou <minachou@andestech.com>
Date: Fri, 12 May 2023 14:02:22 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 041/191] riscv: andes: defconfig: enable CONFIG_HZ_100 for
 andes_defconfig

Signed-off-by: Hui Min Mina Chou <minachou@andestech.com>
---
 arch/riscv/configs/andes_defconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/riscv/configs/andes_defconfig b/arch/riscv/configs/andes_defconfig
index 71bbb5c5359c..b5556e42daf3 100644
--- a/arch/riscv/configs/andes_defconfig
+++ b/arch/riscv/configs/andes_defconfig
@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@
 CONFIG_SYSVIPC=y
 CONFIG_POSIX_MQUEUE=y
 CONFIG_NO_HZ_IDLE=y
+CONFIG_HZ_100=y
 CONFIG_HIGH_RES_TIMERS=y
 CONFIG_BPF_SYSCALL=y
 CONFIG_PREEMPT=y
